1
00:00:05,983 --> 00:00:08,573
- Oh, hey, guys. Where you headed?
- To the comic book store.

2
00:00:08,736 --> 00:00:11,736
You're thinking,
"The comic book store on a Thursday?

3
00:00:11,906 --> 00:00:14,996
(Sheldon:)Why, I've fallen down the rabbit hole
and into a land of madness."

4
00:00:15,159 --> 00:00:20,499
What you have failed to take into account is
that this is Anything Can Happen Thursday.

5
00:00:21,666 --> 00:00:23,166
(Penny:)You got me.

6
00:00:23,334 --> 00:00:26,464
Oh, hey, could you pick me up
a few comics for my nephew's birthday?

7
00:00:26,629 --> 00:00:28,629
No, I think you mean comic books.

8
00:00:28,798 --> 00:00:30,678
Comics are feeble attempts at humor...

9
00:00:30,841 --> 00:00:33,631
(Sheldon:)...featuring talking babies
and anthropomorphized pets...

10
00:00:33,803 --> 00:00:38,053
(Sheldon:)...found traditionally
in the optimistically named "funny pages."

11
00:00:38,724 --> 00:00:41,184
Leonard, pick me up comics
for my nephew's birthday?

12
00:00:41,644 --> 00:00:44,734
- Sure. What does he like?
- I don't know, just pick out anything.

13
00:00:44,897 --> 00:00:47,357
(Sheldon:)Just pick out anything?

14
00:00:47,984 --> 00:00:51,404
Maybe we can pick out a new suit for him
without knowing his size...

15
00:00:51,570 --> 00:00:54,200
(Sheldon:)...or pick out his career
without knowing his aptitude...

16
00:00:54,365 --> 00:00:58,285
(Sheldon:)...or pick out a new breakfast cereal
without knowing his fiber requirements...

17
00:00:58,869 --> 00:01:03,019
(Sheldon:)...or his feelings
about little marshmallows.

